  "description": "One SCB delivery, one register per coding claim. Register n (native id n, variant n*10+2) delivers VALUE of variable 5 in 2020 as CVID n*100+1 unless noted; a list is written name (level): codes, and every item is valid 2000-2030. 31 pinfree, 36 keepgone, 37 overgone, 38 keepmembers: keep (1): 01 Label and other (1): 02 Other. 32 uncoded, 33 omit, 50 cardinality, 61 omitclash: no list. 34 extend, 42 extendgone, 43 extendwitness, 45 extendmembers: VALUE 2019 (CVID n*100+1, no list) and 2020 (CVID n*100+2) under list (1): 01 Label. 46 extendtwice: as 34, with a second list (2): 02 Label on 2020. 44 extendcovered: list (1): 01 Label. 40 uncodedcoded, 41 omitcoded: coded (1): 01 Label. 39 keeptwice and 47 split: keep (1): 01 Label, keep (2): 03 Label, other (1): 02 Other. 51 window, 52 conflict, 53 agree: first (1): 01 Label and second (1): 02 Other. 54 dup: keep (1): 01 Label, other (1): 02 Other and its duplicate other (2): 02 Other; VALUE 2021 (CVID 5402) under future (1): 03 Future. 55 digestdup: keep (1): 01 Label, its duplicate keep (2): 01 Label, other (1): 02 Other. 56 digest: list (1): 01 Label and list (2): 02 Label. 57 digestdrift: list (1): 01 Changed and list (2): 02 Label. 58 partial: VALUE 2020 under keep (1): 01 Label and other (1): 02 Other; VALUE 2021 (CVID 5802) under other (1): 02 Other alone. 62 warning: LA15 (1): LA1501 Label. 63 undated: as 31, plus VALUE in the range-less pooled edition 'HT 2021 - VT 2022' (RegVerID 2122, CVID 6302) under pooled (1): 03 Pooled. 64 undateduncoded: VALUE 2020 with no list, plus the same pooled edition (CVID 6402) under pooled (1): 03 Pooled. 65 owncert, 66 owncertraw, 69 owncertperiod, 70 docauthority: Own list (1): 01 Label. 67 owncertlabel: Own list (1): 01 Changed. 68 owncertmember: Own list (1): 02 Label. SOS register SYN (subset SYN_A, 2019-2021) delivers SHORT, whose Kodlista lists 01 Label for 2020 only, and VARY, whose Kodlista lists 01 Label for 2020 and 02 Label for 2021; EMPTY has the same list as SHORT. An SOS Kodlista has no version label.",
